  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LLAF - PCFML Solomon Islands Locally Led Seaweed Farming for Coastal Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under CARA LLAF FY26/27, the project will strengthen climate resilience in vulnerable coastal communities in the Western Province of the Solomon Islands by strengthening and scaling locally led seaweed farming as a practical adaptation pathway that diversifies livelihoods, reduces pressure on inshore fisheries, and supports community-led marine governance.</narrative>
  </description>
